  "description": "We executed this same strategy with SPY successfully...",
  "body_html": "<p>The melt up is over. Period. We can look in hind sight and confirm this. If you are a new, a melt up is a strong bull market, under poor economic conditions, accompanied with low volume. We are at the tail end of that bull market, and melt ups end with a “blow off top”. Blow off tops are euphoric endings to the bull market. How long are they? Historically they last ~3 months. Some of them are as short as 1 month. I felt it was time to share my final play for 2025. </p><p>Many of you know I love to pick stocks, we have done well all through 2025 (and prior years) with that approach. However, I think going forward to years end, there is a safer, yet profitable appraoach: The Russell 2000. </p><p>With both the S&amp;P 500 and the Russell 2000 gapping up from last week, under terrible economic news, including but not limited to:</p><ul><li><p>Inflation skyrocketing again<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></p></li><li><p>A stagnant labor market, and America’s youngest essentially being pushed out<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a> </p></li><li><p>Government shutdown the 2nd longest on record, also reducing Government Spending…a key component in GDP<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-3\" href=\"#footnote-3\" target=\"_self\">3</a></p></li></ul><p>This is clear indication we are in the blow off top stage. Just ask yourself: does any of this make fundamental sense? If you answer yes, then we will just have to respectfully agree to disagree. </p><p>Regardless, my focus turns to the Russell 2000 because so many stocks have been over looked for more than 3 years…AND… the Russell 2000 obviously broke out. Now normally, I love to go find stocks pushing that index up, however, with a “blow off top, meltdown” in mind, some of those stocks will be performing outstanding on Friday…then plummet on Monday pre-market. I don’t want to find ourselves in those situations (should this entire speculation be accurate). By focusing on the Russell, we can avoid most, if not all, of that potential damage. </p><p>Tickers include <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$IWM&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$VTWO&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. There are others, but I will be using IWM. Ultimately, do what is best for you. These are my opinions and speculations. You are welcome to do something different or have a different opinion. You should always consult a financial advisor….of which 92% of them under perform the S&amp;P 500 long term. 🥴  </p><p>If I do pick up any stocks (you and I both know I probably will 😂), those will posted in the StockTok Summary and in Quick Notes. If you have questions, feel free to ping me in the chat. Please note, I am solo dad this week, so I am coming into the chat about 30 minutes later simply because I am taking them to school. </p><p>Last but not least…thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok?utm_source=user-menu\">StockTok Main Page</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Positions</a> |</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://tradingeconomics.com/united-states/inflation-cpi</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.cnn.com/2025/10/25/business/tech-workers-jobs-fed</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-3\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-3\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">3</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.cbsnews.com/live-updates/government-shutdown-latest-senate-reconvenes-trump-asia/</p><p></p></div></div>",
